// REQUIRED: local replaces for go-cqrs-lite master.
//
// UPDATE 2026-08-11: The original pseudo-version publish bug is FIXED —
// published tags (event/v4.4.0, command/v4.4.0, etc.) now have clean go.mod
// files with real version references. Verified via hermetic GOWORK=off builds.
//
// The replaces are STILL required because go-cqrs-lite master has unreleased
// API changes that cqrs-htmx has migrated to:
//   - ADR-0114: Tombstone-as-domain-event (event.MarkTombstone removed;
//     deletion is now signaled by event type + stack.Materialize.DeleteTypes)
//   - ADR-0111: Branded ActorID (record.CommonMetadata.UserID → ActorID
//     id.ActorID, a kind-discriminated struct with Kind()/String()/Raw())
//
// cqrs-htmx uses meta.ActorID.String() and emits deletion events directly.
// Published tags (event/v4.4.0, record/v4.0.0) still have the OLD API
// (UserID string, MarkTombstone). Hermetic GOWORK=off builds of usermgmt
// and dashboardui will FAIL until go-cqrs-lite publishes tags with these
// changes (event/v4.5.0+, record/v4.2.0+, command/v4.5.0+, query/v4.4.0+).
//
// Removal condition: go-cqrs-lite cuts tags from a tree that includes
// ADR-0114 + ADR-0111, and cqrs-htmx go.mod files are bumped to reference them.
replace github.com/larsartmann/go-cqrs-lite => /home/lars/projects/go-cqrs-lite

replace github.com/larsartmann/go-cqrs-lite/catalog/v4 => /home/lars/projects/go-cqrs-lite/catalog

// REMOVED 2026-08-15: codec/, flightrecorder/, and retry/ replaces.
// go-cqrs-lite deleted these in-repo modules (ADR-0128 extraction to external
// repos go-codec/go-flightrecorder/go-retry, commit 5127039da). The replace
// targets no longer exist, which broke every workspace-mode build. cqrs-htmx
// still requires the published tags (codec/v4.4.0, flightrecorder/v4.0.0,
// retry/v4.x) which resolve from the proxy. Migration to the external
// module paths must wait for post-extraction go-cqrs-lite tags (event/v4.7+
// etc.) because published event/v4.6.0 APIs still take codec/v4 types.
replace github.com/larsartmann/go-cqrs-lite/command/v4 => /home/lars/projects/go-cqrs-lite/command

replace github.com/larsartmann/go-cqrs-lite/commandlifecycle/v4 => /home/lars/projects/go-cqrs-lite/commandlifecycle

